分支机构扩张轨迹，前瞻预判产能外溢与迁移概率；并跨维计算企业需求与区域供给的招商落地匹配度。同时，系统还能穿透税务环保处罚等隐蔽雷区进行全景风控扫描，量化评估企业的经济带动价值，精准定位其在产业链上下游的生态地位。\n\n【适用人群】\n本技能不仅是政企人员的专属外脑，更是各行各业进行商业评估与背景穿透的超级“情报分析师”：\n1. 招商与政府决策：区域招商顾问、驻外招商办、产业规划专家（用于线索初筛、扩产预判、落地匹配度评估）。\n2. 金融与投资机构：VC/PE投资分析师、银行信审与风控专家（用于标的成长性预判、尽职调查、贷前合规审查与贷后风险追踪）。\n3. B端企业服务与供应链：SaaS 大客户销售、供应链法务与采购人员（用于客户资金实力摸排、精准获客画像、供应商防雷排查）。\n4. 职场求职者：准备面试或跳槽的候选人（用于一键查透目标公司底细，判断其营收前景与抗风险能力，精准避开职场天坑）。\n\n只需输入目标企业名称，即可一键唤醒。系统将在数秒内为您生成涵盖企业基础画像、风险评估等级、动态成长预测、核心价值评定及靶向接触建议的一体化长文报告，直接赋能您的日常案头工作与高价值商务决策。\n\n#企业全景尽调 #招商决策分析引擎 #招商引资 #产业研究 #企业服务 #投资尽调 #供应链合作 #政府决策 #工商登记 #股权穿透 #融资事件 #知识产权 #招投标记录 #司法诉讼 #行政处罚 #新闻舆情 #招聘动态 #产业链关系 #全生命周期企业画像 #企业实力评估 #成长潜力预测 #企业风险识别 #招商价值评估 #企业扩产意愿 #企业迁移概率 #企业信息查询 #企业背调 #合作伙伴审查 #企业前景分析 #求职避坑 #银行风控 #SaaS获客", "downloads": 172, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_d277dc19/enterprise-due-diligence-plus", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/a4e49550-e527-4406-b761-c4f2e607b757.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "企业背景调查/商业信息查询PLUS版", "ownerName": "user_d277dc19", "score": 2640.872101949946, "slug": "enterprise-due-diligence-plus", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [{"key": "data-insight", "name": "数据洞察"}, {"key": "data-competitor", "name": "竞品分析"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1782620766632, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.4"}, {"category": "knowledge-management", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1776041736936, "description": "", "description_zh": "A Claude Skill that digests long-form content (podcasts, videos, articles, transcripts) into structured notes. Two modes — Knowledge Mode (archive into your knowledge base) and Publishing Mode (turn into a long-form read or shareable post). Output language follows the user's conversation language. 把任何长内容（文章、播客、视频文字稿、网页）消化成结构化笔记。两种模式：沉淀模式（存进知识库以后用）/ 发布模式（现在快速读完，或整理成可发布的长文）。输出语言根据用户对话语言自动判断（中文 / 英文 / 任何语言均可）。Triggers when the user provides a URL, pastes a transcript, uploads a file, or asks to digest, summarize, take notes on, or process content. 也适用于「帮我消化这个内容」「整理成笔记」「把这篇文章变成笔记」等场景。", "downloads": 172, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_37372691/content-digestion", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/0c9b068f-f22e-44e2-96fe-d2b6f5b43b07.png", "installs": 3, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Content-digestion", "ownerName": "user_37372691", "score": 2934.1521664960765, "slug": "content-digestion", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [{"key": "knowledge-organize", "name": "资料整理"}, {"key": "knowledge-summary", "name": "摘要总结"}, {"key": "knowledge-notes", "name": "笔记整理"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1782611873197, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "business-ops", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": true, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1780809636860, "description": "专业商业计划书生成工具，互动问答模式，多轮对话系统构建完整商业计划书", "description_zh": "专业商业计划书生成工具，交互式问答，多轮对话构建完整计划", "downloads": 172, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/golngod/hutian-opc-business-plan", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 5, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Hutian Opc Business Plan", "ownerName": "golngod", "score": 24536.376604850215, "slug": "hutian-opc-business-plan", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [{"key": "biz-growth", "name": "增长分析"}, {"key": "biz-project-management", "name": "项目管理"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1782592827736, "upstream_owner_login": "golngod", "upstream_url": "https://clawhub.ai/golngod/hutian-opc-business-plan", "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "business-ops", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1779588372900, "description": 