"name": "日报周报"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1782588028055, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.2.0"}, {"category": "content-creation", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1779690164041, "description": "", "description_zh": "媒体战士，写带锋芒的新闻。\n\n你给线索，我铺成稿。不替你写漂亮话——替你把事实排好队，缺的补上，多的砍掉。\n\n阶段 A：收你的材料，搜公开信息，集纳成档，附出处备核验。搜到闭环成形——事实自己能讲出一个故事了——通报你。\n阶段 B：排队，成文。闭环不在明面上说。守成者的数字和挑战者的数字放在相邻段落，时间自己说话。草蛇灰线，伏脉不言。\n四把尺子量每一篇：知微见著，一个现象后面是一整幅图景。妥帖流畅，事实咬合不磕绊。向善促好，写出来的东西往好里推。博文周纳，面上有格局，点上有颗粒。\n\n从”怎么回事捏“到“哦哦对对对”。", "downloads": 172, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_e6fb806d/media-fighter-may2026", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/62f73a9b-1aca-4f8e-921d-6102e258c768.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "mediafighter/媒体战士", "ownerName": "user_e6fb806d", "score": 12527.312454479243, "slug": "media-fighter-may2026", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [{"key": "content-article", "name": "文章写作"}, {"key": "content-topic-planning", "name": "选题策划"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1782588028033, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.1"}]}